tedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned apply-marking-material.\\\",\\\"Tested root on clear meadow ground and observed a visible deposit.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Test deposit mark-26-moss-335.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Applied strokes and neighbors' responses.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Use the existing reserve for three short strokes, share the test finding, and rest nearby.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The test established that this root sample can leave a visible mark on this meadow surface; neighbors have expressed interest in shared drawing.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Staying alive and capable, having enough to eat, and finding people with whom I can build a welcoming everyday life.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","logprobs":[]}

